      appraiserText: "Jan Pieter Glerum (1943-2013) was a well-known art & antique expert and auctioneer. He worked at Sotheby's from 1974 to 1989, and later founded Amsterdam Auctioneers Glerum which he ran from 1989 to 2007. He later became a Dutch television personality, known for his expertise and charismatic presence.",
